---
import { company, history, fullAddress } from '../config';
---
<section class="section" id="heritage" aria-labelledby="heritage-title">
  <div class="wrap heritage-grid">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <p class="kicker">Since {company.foundingYear}</p>
      <h2 id="heritage-title">One family, one address, four generations</h2>
      <p class="lead">Tampa Roofing Company has worked from East Ellicott Street since the business began. Four generations later, the same family still runs it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="heritage-aside" data-reveal>
      <div class="address-plate">
        <span class="plate-label">Same location since {company.foundingYear}</span>
        <span class="plate-value">{company.address.street}<br />{company.address.city}, {company.address.region} {company.address.postalCode}</span>
      </div>
      <p>Long memory matters on a commercial roof. Warranties run for years, maintenance agreements run longer, and the company that installed the roof is still here to answer for it.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="timeline heritage-wide" aria-label="Company timeline">
      {history.map((h) => (
        <li class="tl-item" data-reveal>
          <p class="tl-year">{h.year}</p>
          <p class="tl-title">{h.title}</p>
          <p class="tl-caption">{h.caption}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
